Portrait gameplay: frame at y 250, controls at bottom, pause top-right. It's actually visually okay: HUD top, wave banner, player. The empty space between frame and controls (y 463..730) is large. Could move frame down a bit toward controls? If frame at y ~500 then controls below; empty top 500. Hmm. Or move controls up close to frame (y 490) and leave empty bottom? Not better.

